# Project data — gitignored EXCEPT the slim dashboard cache that ships with
# the deployed Streamlit app (see compute/build_dashboard_cache.py) and the
# last-good OHLCV seed (cold-start floor for the loader's rate-limit-resilient
# merge; carried forward day-to-day via actions/cache — see pipeline.yml).
data/cache/*
!data/cache/dashboard/
!data/cache/ohlcv_daily.parquet
data/snapshots/
logs/

